  {
   "en": "In the class next door there were two identical brothers who had been made to sit in the front row next to the teacher's desk as punishment for messing about in class; once, when a little incident suddenly happened near the desk, the two of them leapt up in perfect sync like trained bodyguards to deal with it, and unexpectedly became the heroes of the day.",
